<p>South Humberside Jul 84.00 first half Aug 85.50</p>
<p>Yorkshire first half Aug 85.50/85.00</p>
<p>Liverpool first half Aug 88.00</p>
<p>Shropshire/Cheshire Jul 86.00 first half Aug 87.00</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk Jul 84.00 first half Aug 85.50</p>
<p>West Devon Jul 85.00</p>
<p>Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire, Northampton and Oxfordshire Jul 83.50/83.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Suffolk/Essex asa 75.00/75.50 Oct/Dec 83.00</p>
<p>West Norfolk asa 75.00/76.00</p>
<p>Norfolk Spot 77.00</p>
<p>Southampton asa 75.00/75.50/76.00</p>
<p>Avon four Oct/Dec 82.50</p>
